# Project Context

- **Product:** Guitar HQ — Max for Live **Audio Effect** command center for Ableton Live **12.4+**
- **Target rack:** `2026 Guitar Rack` (see `ghq_rack_map.expectedRack`; preset path is documented in `README.md` only)
- **Behavior:** Passes audio through; controls nearby rack devices via **LiveAPI** (no MIDI generation)
- **Runtime:** Max `js` (engine) and `jsui` (compact + editor) with **ES5-style** JavaScript (`var`, `function`, no bundler)
- **Tooling:** **Node.js** for `ghq_rack_map.test.js`, `node --check` on `.js` files, and `scripts/*` only
- **Not in this repo:** React, TypeScript app, npm dependencies beyond scripts, Tailwind, Vite, `docs/` from other M4L projects

## Device files (keep in sync together)

Sync copies all of these to the User Library (see `scripts/sync-user-library.js`):

- `ghq_engine.js` — LiveAPI scan, bindings, parameter I/O, events
- `ghq_rack_map.js` — control definitions and device/parameter aliases
- `ghq_compact_ui.js` — Live device strip UI
- `ghq_editor_ui.js` — editor subpatcher UI
- `ghq_ui_shared.js` — shared drawing helpers (`include("ghq_ui_shared.js")`)
- `Guitar-HQ.amxd` — loadable device (`.js` must sit beside it in User Library)

Patch shell: `guitar-hq.maxpat` (generated via `scripts/build-device-patch.js`).

## Rack map (`ghq_rack_map.js`)

- **`deviceAliases`:** logical keys (`utility`, `ampSims`, …) → possible Live device names
- **`controls[]`:** each control has `id`, `label`, `section`, `kind`, `deviceKey`, and usually `parameter` (alias list)
- **`kind`:** `slider` | `toggle` | `select` | `device_toggle` (and map-specific patterns)
- **Nested amp rack:** Bassman chain — `Saturn 2`, `NA Faceman`, first `Cab IRs`; Dumble chain — `NA Overdrive Special`, second `Cab IRs` (`deviceIndex` 0/1)
- **`optional: true`:** control may be absent without failing the map count
- After adding/changing controls, run `node ghq_rack_map.test.js` and update both UIs if they hard-code sections

## Live usage expectations

- Drop device **next to** or **inside** the guitar rack chain on the same track
- Click **Scan** after moving/renaming devices
- Compact UI: quick Utility / Amp Sims / core toggles; **Edit** opens full editor subpatcher

## Editing discipline

- Match existing **mgraphics** style and `ghq_shared.colors` in UI files
- Do not hand-edit `.amxd` binary structure; regenerate via `build-device-patch.js`
- Do not copy Kick Snare Hat (`ksh_*`) patterns — this repo uses `ghq_*` and Audio Effect metadata (`aaaameta` value 7)
